preconception evaluation and consultation.
She has the past history of tonic-clonic
epilepsy, but has been seizure-free for the
past 2 years while on phenytoin. She is
currently on oral contraceptive pills. An EEG is
obtained that excludes any epileptiform
activity. On examination, there is no focal
neurological finding. Which one of the
following would be the most appropriate
advice?','{"A":"Cease phenytoin and change to\ncarbamazepine.","B":"Discontinue phenytoin.","C":"Advise that she should not become\npregnant.","D":"Continue phenytoin, but add high\ndose folic acid according to current\nrecommendations.","E":"Check serum phenytoin level and\ndecrease the dose if appropriate."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 OBS (2).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-d8701fa2dd38","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"a8d1aa2510bf005c5bce","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 OBS (2).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 OBS (2).pdf","source_page":149,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"ac7bdc8e4a576984a6f7","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 OBS (2).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 OBS (2).pdf","source_page":150,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"01a601a9d5db1f0fba51","record_type":"visual_mcq","source_file":"Obstetrics and Gynaecology Amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Obstetrics and Gynaecology Amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":269,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"c432c733a50eec5c214b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":877,"source_qid":"573"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"a8d1aa2510bf005c5bce","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 OBS (2).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 OBS (2).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":149,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Obstetrics","stem":"A 24-year-old woman comes for\npreconception evaluation and consultation.\nShe has the past history of tonic-clonic\nepilepsy, but has been seizure-